<title>NETHERLANDS: ING Barings raises CMG estimates.</title>
<headline>ING Barings raises CMG estimates.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Sept 18 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector------------Price---Broker----------</p>
<p>    CMG	   Computer Services 18.20   ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Hold. First half results excellent. Turnover in</p>
<p>Netherlands up impressive 32 pct, and in UK profit up 78 pct.</p>
<p>Germany remains difficult. Healthy market growth expected.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1996		   0.69     0.65     N/A	 N/A</p>
<p>    1997		   0.83     0.75     N/A	 N/A</p>
<p>    1998		   0.98     0.86     N/A	 N/A</p>
